<view class="page account-page"><image class="account-cover" src="/assets/leaves.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><text class="eyebrow">A LITTLE SPACE FOR YOU</text><view class="page-title">进入你的夏日</view><view class="muted">本地账户 · 记录保存在这台设备</view><view class="account-row" wx:for="{{accounts}}" wx:key="id"><view class="avatar" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="enter"><image src="/assets/icons/{{item.avatar}}.png"/></view><view class="grow" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="enter"><view class="bold">{{item.name}}</view><text class="small muted">{{item.demo?'独立示例空间':'个人手账'}}{{active===item.id?' · 当前账户':''}}</text></view><button class="icon-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove" aria-label="删除账户"><image src="/assets/icons/trash-2.png"/></button></view><view class="section-heading">新的开始</view><input class="field" maxlength="24" placeholder="给自己取一个昵称" value="{{name}}" bindinput="input"/><button class="primary" bindtap="create">创建本地账户</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="demo">进入演示空间</button><view class="footer-note">本地账户不是微信登录，也不提供加密保护。<br/>卸载或清除数据前，请先备份。</view></view>
